description:
Write `fn by_extension(paths: &[&str]) -> BTreeMap<String, Vec<String>>` using `std::path::Path`. Each path is put under its extension, lower-cased (`"JPG"` and `"jpg"` go together); a path without an extension goes under `"(none)"`. The list under each extension holds the **file names** (not the whole paths), in the order given.

```rust
by_extension(&["photos/a.JPG", "b.jpg", "notes/readme", "x/y/z.tar.gz"]);
// {"(none)": ["readme"], "gz": ["z.tar.gz"], "jpg": ["a.JPG", "b.jpg"]}
```

